<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνωμ-ονέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνώμων</span>, <i>act without right
				feeling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				1.7.33
			</span></i>; coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδικεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.69
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. εἴς τινα</span>
			<i>to act unfeelingly</i> or <i>unfairly towards</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				292
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
				</span></i>
			 Com.<i><span class="en">
				7.6
			</span></i>: with a neut.Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή νυν τὰ θνητὰ θνητὸς ὢν ἀγνωμόνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
					112
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>disregard a summons, be contumacious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PStrassb.
				41.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. περί τινα, περί
				τι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cam.</u>
				28
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>treat unfairly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Him.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.31
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be so treated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.484b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνωμονηθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cam.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ πατρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					237v40
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>act ill-advisedly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				13.13
			</span></i>.</div>
